{"unit_id":"tag:04TM:statement","translation":"本例是例<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>的类似构造，以预层（presheaves）替代“范畴（categories）的预层（presheaves）”。所得将是范畴（category），它纤维化（fibred）于集合（sets），而非纤维化范畴（fibred category）。假设<MATH_0001>为预层（presheaf）。对于<MATH_0002>，它属于<MATH_0003>，我们将使用启发性记号<MATH_0004>。如下构造范畴（category）<MATH_0005>，它在<MATH_0006>上纤维化（fibred）于集合（sets）。定义\n<MATH_0007>\n对于<MATH_0008>，定义\n<MATH_0009>\n复合（Composition）来自<MATH_0010>中的复合（composition），这是可行的，因为<MATH_0011>对<MATH_0012>中的一对可复合态射（morphisms）成立。函子（functor）<MATH_0013>由规则<MATH_0014>给出。由于每个纤维范畴（category）<MATH_0015>都是离散的（discrete），其底层集合（set）为<MATH_0016>，且我们已在例<REF_0003>中看到<MATH_0017>是群胚纤维化范畴（category fibred in groupoids），可得<MATH_0018>纤维化（fibred）于集合（sets）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fibred","target_term":"纤维化"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"fibred category","target_term":"纤维化范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fibred","target_term":"纤维化"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散的"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"底层集合"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维化范畴"},{"source_term":"fibred","target_term":"纤维化"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"给定及作为对照的预层；待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"用于构造的预层；待决。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"对照预层的取值；待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_