{"unit_id":"tag:0044:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为范畴（category）。设<MATH_0002>。考虑可表的（representable）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0003>（见例<REF_0001>）。另一方面，考虑范畴（category）<MATH_0004>，它来自例<REF_0002>。纤维范畴（category）<MATH_0005>以态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>为对象（objects），且态射（morphisms）只有恒等（identities）。因此，在引理<REF_0003>的对应下，有\n<MATH_0007>\n换言之，范畴（category）<MATH_0008>典范地等价（equivalent）于范畴（category）<MATH_0009>，后者与<MATH_0010>相关联，见例<REF_0004>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"identities","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"基底、切片、纤维及关联范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"给定预层的可表性；待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"可表预层；待决。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"切片纤维的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"纤维中的对象表示及态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"identities","target_term":"恒等","context":"纤维中仅有的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"切片与预层关联范畴间的典范等价；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
